---
layout: base.njk
title: Articles & Operational Guides | CaulHaus
description: "Practical blueprints, capacity planning architectures, and delivery operations guides for 20–150 person agencies and consultancies."
permalink: /blog/
---

<!-- Hero Section -->
<section class="max-w-container-max mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-gutter pt-24 pb-section-gap-sm text-center reveal">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center gap-6">
    <div class="inline-block border border-outline-variant/30 rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-xs">
      <span class="font-mono-label text-mono-label text-electric-blue uppercase tracking-wider font-bold">Articles &amp; Architecture</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="font-display-lg text-display-lg text-deep-charcoal">
      Pragmatic Operations Blueprints<br>
      <span class="text-electric-blue">for Growing Agencies.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-slate-gray max-w-xl font-light leading-relaxed">
      No fluff or generic advice. Real capacity architectures, time-loss diagnostics, and workflow automations built for 20–150 person service organizations.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Blog Posts Grid -->
<section class="max-w-container-max mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-gutter py-12 reveal">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-stretch">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
    <article class="glass-panel p-8 rounded-3xl border border-outline-variant/40 flex flex-col justify-between bg-white/90 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300">
      <div class="space-y-5">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="bg-electric-blue/10 text-electric-blue text-xs font-mono-label px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
            {{ post.data.categories or "OPERATIONS" }}
          </span>
          <time class="font-mono-label text-xs text-slate-400" datetime="{{ post.date }}">
            {{ post.date | readableDate }}
          </time>
        </div>
        
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md font-bold text-deep-charcoal mb-3 hover:text-electric-blue transition-colors">
            <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-slate-gray font-light leading-relaxed text-sm">
            {{ post.data.description }}
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-6 mt-6 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <img src="/assets/images/about_hero.png" alt="Alex Herbstman" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full object-cover border border-slate-200">
          <div>
            <span class="font-body-md text-xs font-semibold text-deep-charcoal block">Alex Herbstman</span>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 block font-light">Founder, CaulHaus</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-body-md text-sm font-semibold text-electric-blue hover:text-electric-blue/80 transition-colors">
          Read Guide <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">arrow_forward</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Bottom CTA Section -->
<section class="max-w-container-max mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-gutter py-16 reveal">
  <div class="glass-panel p-10 md:p-14 rounded-3xl border border-outline-variant/40 bg-gradient-to-br from-white/95 to-slate-50/90 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto shadow-sm">
    <span class="font-mono-label text-xs text-electric-blue uppercase tracking-wider font-bold block mb-3">TAKE ACTION</span>
    <h3 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg font-bold text-deep-charcoal mb-4">
      Ready to get your team out of fragile spreadsheets?
    </h3>
    <p class="text-slate-gray font-light max-w-xl mx-auto mb-8 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
      Our 2-Week Workflow &amp; Capacity Audit diagnoses your delivery bottlenecks, quantifies your non-billable spreadsheet waste, and deploys your first working automation prototype.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
      <a href="/contact/?area=Audit" class="bg-electric-blue text-white px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl font-body-md text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-electric-blue/90 transition-all shadow-md active:scale-95">
        Request a 2-Week Audit
      </a>
      <a href="/services/" class="bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 text-deep-charcoal border border-slate-200 px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl font-body-md text-sm font-semibold transition-all">
        Explore How We Work
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
